  "display_title": "The Secret Bedroom of the Abandoned Princess",
  "description": "After her mother is executed for treason, Princess Llewellyn is shunned by high society and stripped of her rightful claim to the throne. So lowly does she become, that she is left with no one to protect her when she is kidnapped by dark mages and cursed with a wicked spell of lust. With no choice but to satisfy her desires as the curse demands, Llewellyn finds herself falling into the arms of unexpected suitors. But this life of lust can only go on for so long before the flames of passion begin to burn out of control…\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
